    "body": "This is hard problem to solve in general, since non monotonically increasing dts is basically a corrupt file. And to fix a corrupt file, you need to do some hacks to \"guess\" what the original intent of the data was.\n\nBut if you can share the source, e.g. on dropbox or drive or something, I'll try to fix smartcut to work on this type of error.",
